{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:18.06] Mmmm, mm\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:29.14] Every day I wake up, get to the cake\n[00:29.98] Rainy or sunny, it's money to make\n[00:31.62] If I'm down bad, it’s just too bad\n[00:33.54] Hands in the air, all your money I'll take\n[00:35.40] Sittin' up in the trap with a safe like a bank\n[00:37.02] Didn't believe in me, niggas was saying I can't\n[00:38.76] Now I'm riding in a Hellcat, matte black paint\n[00:40.64] Move it slow like a snail in a Lambo race\n[00:42.82] Speed it up, speed it up, change the pace\n[00:44.26] Drown in lean and smoke the dank\n[00:46.08] My weed stank, it'll make you faint\n[00:47.72] Yo' nigga a joke, he a hoax and a prank\n[00:49.46] He get shot in the throat if you get in the way, hey\n[00:51.72] No hesitation, I don't blink, hey\n[00:53.74] It's gettin' cold outside, hey\n[00:56.70] So I went out and bought me a mink, let's go!\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[01:07.64] All my niggas gon' ride (Hey)\n[01:09.98] All my niggas gon' slide (Okay)\n[01:15.22] For me, they would die, even if I ain't provide\n[01:18.80] Hit him with the .9, knock him down to size (Fuck)\n[01:22.62] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised (Let's go)\n[01:46.18] All my niggas gon' ride (Yeah)\n[01:51.28] All my niggas gon' slide (Grrt, yeah)\n[01:58.22] For me, they would die (Oh yeah), even if I ain't provide\n[02:07.40] Hit him with the .9 (Brr, brr), knock him down to size (Brr, fuck)\n[02:16.16] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised (Let's go)\n[Verse 2: Ski Mask The Slump God]\n[02:30.98] All of these niggas (Yuh), all of these bitches (Yuh)\n[02:45.81] Bug me like critters (Yuh), whip cocoon, caterpillars (Yuh, yuh)\n[03:00.63] You a Jake like where Finn is, (Yuh) sippin' purple, no Grimace (Yeah)\n[03:15.46] Couple racks on me like I play tennis, not vegan, got carrots and lettuce (Yuh, yuh)\n[03:30.28] All of my niggas is gone, all of your niggas is gone\n[03:30.77] Make him pickup like \"Answer the phone\" (Yeah), like an alarm, bitch, I'm settin' the tone (Yuh)\n[03:31.26] PJ to Chicago for linens, (Yuh) you'll never catch me out at Lenox\n[03:31.74] You niggas see through just like linens\n[03:32.23] Keep a .40 inside of my denim (Inside of my denim)\n[Verse 3: Juice WRLD]\n[03:32.72] I roll with G-Money we getting the millions\n[03:33.06] The sky is the limit, I don't got no limits\n[03:33.39] Gang, gang, gang, gang, bitch, I'm No Limit\n[03:33.73] I don't wanna drink sprite if it ain't got a four in\n[03:34.06] I ain't hop in the car, if it don't got a pole in it\n[03:34.40] PJ to the A, I'ma buy new linens\n[03:34.73] Mansion in Atlanta just for Christmas\n[03:35.07] Kel-Tec and some Hi-Tec on my wishlist\n[03:35.40] I get high and tell all my demons \"Go away\"\n[03:36.21] Diamonds on me, that's why I'm frozen in the rain\n[03:37.01] I be fly as a superhero with a cape\n[03:37.82] All my hoodies orangutan, yeah, they Bape\n[03:38.02] Poppin' wheelies on four wheelers, do a scrape\n[03:38.23] While G-Money go one-twenty in a straight\n[03:38.43] We get money like three hundred for the stage\n[03:38.63] Yeah, I run it, got my lyrics in their brain\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[03:38.83] All my niggas gon' ride\n[03:39.04] All my niggas gon' slide\n[03:39.24] For me, they would die, even if I ain't provide\n[03:42.06] Hit him with the .9 knock him down to size (Fuck)\n[03:45.78] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass, a compromised (Let's go)\n[03:46.03] All my niggas gon' ride (Yeah)\n[02:58.75] All my niggas gon' slide (Brr, yeah)\n[02:58.75] For me, they would die (Oh yeah), even if I ain't provide\n[02:58.75] Hit him with the .9 (Brr, brr), knock him down to size (Brr, fuck)\n[02:58.75] I forgot my pipe, so I beat his ass and compromised","words":[[17.88,18.0,"[Intro]"],[18.06,18.18,"Mmmm"],[28.28,28.42,"(Ayy,"],[28.5,28.62,"KBeaZy,"],[28.66,28.74,"you"],[28.78,28.86,"fired"],[28.9,28.92,"up)"],[28.96,29.04,"[Verse"],[29.